{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-o035c","title":"关羽退麦城伪降遁走孙权遣朱然潘璋断路","accounts":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-o035c-account","label":"《吴主传第二》正文","text":"关羽退麦城伪降遁走孙权遣朱然潘璋断路","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o035c-q"]},{"id":"chenghuang-a-f4be52ce5e0eb4e745d7","label":"正文","text":"璋与朱然断羽走道马忠擒羽","evidence":["chenghuang-q-8b3b0fde853ec52e5949"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0172","role":"退走","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o035c-q"]},{"person":"sun-quan","role":"诱降遣军","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o035c-q"]},{"person":"mingdi-p0046","role":"截路","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o035c-q"]},{"person":"zhouyu-p0055","role":"截路","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o035c-q"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0016","role":"擒关羽关平赵累等","evidence":["chenghuang-q-8b3b0fde853ec52e5949"]},{"person":"guanzhang-p0002","role":"被擒","evidence":["chenghuang-q-8b3b0fde853ec52e5949"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0017","role":"被擒","evidence":["chenghuang-q-8b3b0fde853ec52e5949"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":219,"label":"闰月","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"wuzhu-y219","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"wuzhu-q-o034","basis":"闰月"},"evidence":["wuzhu-e-o035c-q","wuzhu-q-o034","guanzhang-q-o008","guanzhang-q-b-edafc9276d2732d2c2af"]},"ordering_evidence":"wuzhu-e-o035c-q","source_order":[47,153,"O035c"],"order":8195}],"persons":[{"id":"guanzhang-p0002","name":"关平","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"mingdi-p0046","name":"朱然","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"sun-quan","name":"孙权","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0172","name":"关羽","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wuzhu-p0016","name":"马忠","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wuzhu-p0017","name":"赵累","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"zhouyu-p0055","name":"潘璋","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"chenghuang-q-8b3b0fde853ec52e5949","section":"chapter-055","block":"b-e020347f9b719be7d652","layer":"original","quote":"权征关羽，璋与朱然断羽走道。到临沮〖6〗，住夹石〖7〗，璋部下司马马忠擒羽〖8〗，并羽子平、都督赵累等","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":331,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":51,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"guanzhang-q-b-edafc9276d2732d2c2af","section":"chapter-036","block":"b-edafc9276d2732d2c2af","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二十四年：建安二十四年（公元 219）。","section_title":"关张马黄赵传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0078.xhtml","index":42,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-16dc4b02f597093385c1","start":0,"end":23,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"guanzhang-q-o008","section":"chapter-036","block":"b-b96955cde6bd0ef2541b","layer":"original","quote":"二十四年〖1〗，先主为汉中王；拜羽为前将军，假节、钺。是岁，羽率众攻曹仁于樊。曹公遣于禁助仁。秋，大霖雨，汉水泛溢，禁所督七军皆没；禁降羽，羽又斩将军庞德〖2〗；梁、郏、陆浑群盗或遥受羽印号〖3〗，为之支党。羽威震华夏〖4〗，曹公议徙许都，以避其锐。司马宣王、蒋济以为：“关羽得志，孙权必不愿也。可遣人劝权蹑其后〖5〗，许割江南以封权，则樊围自解。”曹公从之。","section_title":"关张马黄赵传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0078.xhtml","index":35,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":180,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o035c-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-83834db77f87d5f2c6c1","layer":"original","quote":"关羽还当阳〖18〗，西保麦城〖19〗。权使诱之。羽伪降，立幡旗为象人于城上〖20〗，因遁走；兵皆解散，尚十余骑。权先使朱然、潘璋断其径路〖21〗。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":152,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":105,"end":178,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o034","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-39b849dfb87fdd3c9c49","layer":"original","quote":"二十四年〖8〗，关羽围曹仁于襄阳；曹公遣左将军于禁救之〖9〗。会汉水暴起，羽以舟兵尽虏禁等步骑三万，送江陵，惟城未拔。权内惮羽，外欲以为己功；笺与曹公〖10〗，乞以讨羽自效〖11〗。曹公且欲使羽与权相持以斗之，驿传权书；使曹仁以弩射示羽，羽犹豫不能去。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":151,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":126,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
